    "message": "Merge PR #311: manual Sub2API gpt-6-astra validator compatibility smoke\n\nOne manual-only workflow, no Research/HiThink/Odds/Action or recurring API activation. Fixed HTTPS endpoint and gpt-6-astra request model; only SUB2API_API_KEY secret; contents:read, non-persisted checkout credentials, official codex-action with CLI0.153.4 and workspace profile. Actual provider compatibility remains untested.\n\nReviewed exact head f9efc659ed87a779cd1d8c46b424f9ff1f6bba3b against unchanged base14ec46dc282246b9d75a1e34b53df886802724ae. Full PR CI34471934121/test102853610294:2374 passed659.67s; entire log read, checkout2d08be65cc66a9cc7f7a0ff8d9a5547f1708ccb4 parents/tree55a92a15163c0119159b513de3a7de97834a4afe reconciled. Local exact-workflow YAML/six bash syntax checks only, not local full-suite execution. AI review5166655231, not independent Human audit.\n\nSmoke acceptance requires actual Codex command/test logs in addition to file-based status checks; no tamper-proof attestation or backend-model certification is claimed. One session can involve multiple model requests;20min timeout is not a monetary cap. Main CI and one fresh manual smoke remain separate. Preserve23:10 read-only Brief and #297 plan.",
